# CI gates

Commands match `.github/workflows/ci.yaml`. PR titles stay in `pr-conventional-commits`.

## style

```sh
cargo fmt --all --check
typos
```

## clippy

```sh
cargo clippy --all -- -D warnings
```

## web

From `web/`:

```sh
bun install --frozen-lockfile
bunx vp check
bun run build
```

## test

```sh
cargo build --verbose
cargo nextest run --verbose --no-tests=pass
```

## docs

```sh
RUSTDOCFLAGS="-D warnings" cargo doc --no-deps --document-private-items
```

## machete

```sh
cargo machete
```

## mutants

Pull-request Rust diffs only. Write the base-branch diff first:

```sh
git diff origin/main... > git.diff
cargo mutants --no-shuffle -vV --in-diff git.diff
```

UI or GraphQL changes: `.cursor/skills/verify-klens/SKILL.md`.
